video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/6a0f19ae8f170ea476bbbb2ea610c694.avif?t=1758996699\" width=1536 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clothing is one of the most vivid ways to step into the past. Every culture expressed identity, status, and tradition through fabric, color, and ornament. In this project, you’ll see garments recreated with historical accuracy and brought to life in 3D detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/932392196a25947dda984c648cd426f8.poster.avif?t=1758996699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/932392196a25947dda984c648cd426f8.webm?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/932392196a25947dda984c648cd426f8.mp4?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From everyday wear to festive attire, you’ll learn how people dressed for work, family gatherings, or celebrations. Embroidery and patterns carried hidden meanings, often tied to protection, fertility, or regional identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jewelry, belts, and headpieces added layers of symbolism and artistry, reflecting both beauty and social role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided hosts, dressed in authentic clothing, will explain the materials, techniques, and traditions behind each garment. You’ll discover how fabric was woven, dyed, and stitched, and how clothing evolved across time — offering not just protection, but a living canvas of cultural heritage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/ab226801a4053d6e57ce453e4f3f9de0.poster.avif?t=1758996699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/ab226801a4053d6e57ce453e4f3f9de0.webm?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/ab226801a4053d6e57ce453e4f3f9de0.mp4?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/1b743c741858109c33393943d5914c37.avif?t=1758996699\" width=1536 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond houses and clothing, the virtual museum showcases the objects that filled daily life. Tools, furniture, kitchenware, and handmade ornaments are presented in interactive detail. Each artifact comes with explanations of its purpose and meaning, helping you connect the practical with the symbolic. Together, they paint a fuller picture of how people lived, worked, and celebrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/12d5b064f4c0ff9404ea20bd08f003e1.poster.avif?t=1758996699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/12d5b064f4c0ff9404ea20bd08f003e1.webm?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/12d5b064f4c0ff9404ea20bd08f003e1.mp4?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/01c1c8a73b696613c264e4b43b7735e5.poster.avif?t=1758996699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/01c1c8a73b696613c264e4b43b7735e5.webm?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/01c1c8a73b696613c264e4b43b7735e5.mp4?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/5575b29f625d6787b97116291b02c572.avif?t=1758996699\" width=1536 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe history should be accessible to everyone, everywhere. That's why &quot;The time within us&quot; is designed as a multi-platform experience, allowing you to choose how you want to learn and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Tours</strong>: Watch guided narratives on YouTube for a documentary-style experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC/Desktop Mode</strong>: Explore with the same freedom, no headset required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR Mode</strong>: Planned for the near future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/086dcaf0e9c461fec54be8b89bdf82b3.poster.avif?t=1758996699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/086dcaf0e9c461fec54be8b89bdf82b3.webm?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/extras/086dcaf0e9c461fec54be8b89bdf82b3.mp4?t=1758996699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Faithfully reconstructed  house based on real history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Interactive objects that reveal stories, meaning, and daily use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Voice-acted hosts in authentic clothing guide your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Virtual museum of artifacts, clothing, and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-“Then &amp; Now” comparisons showing how life has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple ways to experience:  PC, or guided video tours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A growing project with new houses, traditions, and cultures to be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Travel back in time and follow our ancestors into their homes. Hear stories from the past, discover the traditions that shaped daily life, and experience culture through interactive exploration. &quot;The Time Within Us&quot; is your personal journey into the heart of history.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/705fb9e9a9f2ebdbc52b98255f34ce27fce1c92b/header.jpg?t=1758996699", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/d6f7df542f382c15b98c05d01cfca2fddd3c808d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758996699", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363260/d6f7df542f382c15b98c05d01cfca2fddd3c808d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758996699", "website": "https://www.littlespacedot.com/thetimewithinus", "pc